## 5. Architectural Recommendations

1. **Production Model Selection**: Deploy the **ANN model**. It achieves an 86% accuracy rate and dramatically higher churn capture (75% recall vs. 6% on Logistic Regression).
2. **Preprocessing Pipeline Enforcement**: Integrate `StandardScaler` directly into a production `Pipeline` export (e.g., via `joblib` or ONNX format) to avoid data leakage during real-time inference.
3. **Threshold Tuning**: Adjust the default output sigmoid threshold ($\tau = 0.5$) based on the operational trade-off between customer retention campaigns (False Positives) and uncaptured churn (False Negatives).
